--- task
id: a01
dataset: attribution
kind: sum per group, ordered by the aggregate
answer: fewest

--- intent
What is the total touchpoint weight on each source? Return the source slug and the summed weight as `total`, heaviest first.

--- edition2
query weight_per_source() {
  match { $t: Touchpoint  $t touchpointOnSource $s }
  return { $s.slug, sum($t.weight) as total }
  order { total desc }
}

--- edition3
query weight_per_source() {
  match { $t: Touchpoint  $t touchpointOnSource $s }
  return { $s.slug, sum($t.weight) as total }
  order { total desc }
}

--- expect ordered
columns: ["s.slug","total"]
["excluded",18.0]
["s1",13.0]
["s2",2.0]
["s3",1.0]
